WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.200
♪ Upright piano: a light ragtime ♪

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:29.000
♪ A new strain begins ♪

00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:06.300
♪ The left hand strides, the tune swings on ♪

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:52.000
♪ Another strain, still unhurried ♪

00:02:48.600 --> 00:02:52.600
♪ The tune shifts into a new key ♪

00:02:56.700 --> 00:03:00.700
♪ The ragtime picks back up ♪

00:03:47.400 --> 00:03:53.000
♪ Slowing to a soft final chord ♪
